          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "계네빈이 {NICKNAME} 님을 단톡방에 초대했습니다",
          "next": [
            145440102
          ]
        },
        "145440102": {
          "id": 145440102,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "text": "패밀리 여러분",
          "next": [
            145440103
          ]
        },
        "145440103": {
          "id": 145440103,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "text": "저 할 말이 있어요——",
          "next": [
            145440104
          ]
        },
        "145440104": {
          "id": 145440104,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1201,
          "text": "너무 귀여운 거 아니야!?",
          "next": [
            145440105
          ]
        },
        "145440105": {
          "id": 145440105,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "text": "맞아! 특히 말썽꾸러기는 나랑 같이 집에 가고 싶어 하는 거 같았어",
          "next": [
            145440106
          ]
        },
        "145440106": {
          "id": 145440106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "아스타 님이 헤르타 님을 단톡방에 초대했습니다",
          "next": [
            145440107
          ]
        },
        "145440107": {
          "id": 145440107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1013,
          "text": "크흠",
          "next": [
            145440108
          ]
        },
        "145440108": {
          "id": 145440108,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1013,
          "text": "소신 발언 하나만 할게. 훈련을 계속한다면 등꽃 과자는 더 많은 마법을 배울 수 있을 거야",
          "next": [
            145440109
          ]
        },
        "145440109": {
          "id": 145440109,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1013,
          "text": "미모는 이미 탑급이라 더 발전할 수 없어 보이지만",
          "next": [
            145440110
          ]
        },
        "145440110": {
          "id": 145440110,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "text": "잠깐! 혼자만 몰래 강해지기 없어요!",
          "next": [
            145440111
          ]
        },
        "145440111": {
          "id": 145440111,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1201,
          "text": "내가 행운의 디저트가 될 수 있다면 얼마나 좋을까…?",
          "next": [
            145440112
          ]
        },
        "145440112": {
          "id": 145440112,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1201,
          "text": "옥조가 가까워지면 자동으로 먹통이 돼서, 더 이상 업무 연락을 받을 수 없으면 좋겠다",
          "next": [
            145440113
          ]
        },
        "145440113": {
          "id": 145440113,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1013,
          "text": "첫 번째 꿈은 내가 이뤄줄 수 있는데, 한번 해볼래?",
          "next": [
            145440114
          ]
        },
        "145440114": {
          "id": 145440114,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1201,
          "text": "거절할게요!",
          "next": [
            145440115,
            145440118
          ]
        },
        "145440115": {
          "id": 145440115,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "작은 창조물들의 경기에 숨은 고수들이 이렇게 많을 줄이야",
          "next": [
            145440116
          ]
        },
        "145440116": {
          "id": 145440116,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "text": "그야 경기 실황 생중계에 해설까지 있으니까요",
          "next": [
            145440117
          ]
        },
        "145440117": {
          "id": 145440117,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "next": [
            145440121
          ]
        },
        "145440118": {
          "id": 145440118,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "순위 때문에 선수들의 노력이 퇴색되지 않았으면 좋겠어",
          "next": [
            145440119
          ]
        },
        "145440119": {
          "id": 145440119,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1013,
          "text": "그래서, 손쉽게 이긴 건 과연 누구일까?",
          "next": [
            145440120
          ]
        },
        "145440120": {
          "id": 145440120,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1201,
          "next": [
            145440121
          ]
        },
        "145440121": {
          "id": 145440121,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1210,
          "text": "{NICKNAME} 씨, 응원하는 선수에게 하고 싶은 말이 있나요?",
          "next": [
            145440122,
            145440123
          ]
        },
        "145440122": {
          "id": 145440122,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "솔직히 말하면, 그 디저트가 대체 무슨 맛일지 궁금해",
          "next": [
            145440124
          ]
        },
        "145440123": {
          "id": 145440123,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
